# VIP Pubkeys
#
# One pubkey per line. Supports hex (64 chars) and npub (bech32) formats.
# Pages from these pubkeys get extended CDN cache TTLs.
# Empty lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# pensieve-preview reads PREVIEW_VIP_FILE (default ".vip", relative to the
# service WorkingDirectory=/home/pensieve/pensieve). Copy to that location and
# edit, or point PREVIEW_VIP_FILE at another path:
#   cp ops/production/.vip.example /home/pensieve/pensieve/.vip

# Example hex pubkey
# 82341f882b6eabcd2ba7f1ef90aad961cf074af15b9ef44a09f9d2a8fbfbe6a2

# Example npub
# npub1sg6plzptd64u62a878hep2kev3zah5gjcnrm4ggn8ky4rfu7dlhks42twg2
